    "regime_notes": "2020-2022 IC/ICIR 0.039469/0.122291; 2023-2025 0.019010/0.061536; 2026-2031 0.037308/0.118014. Recent regime is supportive; 2023-2025 stability was weaker. Small 15-instrument cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
    "decay": "Same-horizon admission is next-day only; longer-horizon decay was not used for admission and requires follow-up."
